MIT-licensed files in libwim

wimlib 1.14.4 compiles the source files listed below into libwim-15.dll. Their headers put them
under the MIT licence that follows instead of the GNU LGPL. The copyright lines and the permission
notice are copied from those headers, and the permission notice is the same in every one of them.

The other files compiled into libwim carry the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 3 or
later, in their headers, or no licence header, which leaves them under COPYING. None of them is
placed in the public domain. src/compress_common.c and src/lzms_compress.c say that parts of them
are based on public domain 7-Zip and LZMA code by Igor Pavlov.

